  "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Carter weekender is built for spontaneous escapes and airport sprints alike. Interior and front slip pockets keep your essentials organized, while a trolley sleeve slips easily over your suitcase and a detachable strap adapts to your travel style. Crafted from lightweight recycled nylon, this travel bag balances form and function with a clean, modern finish.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> 100% Recycled Nylon</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> 2 Way Script Logo Lining</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 23&quot; At Longest</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior Back Zip Pocket, Front Slip Pockets</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip Closure</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
